.TH stool-apple 1  "stool-apple "
.SH NAME
stool\-apple \- Manage macOS preferences and Homebrew independently of dotfiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-apple\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage macOS preferences and Homebrew independently of dotfiles
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
stool\-apple\-init(1)
Set the current user\*(Aqs Dock minimization animation to suck
.TP
stool\-apple\-brew(1)
Initialize Homebrew and install software from a Brewfile
.TP
stool\-apple\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
